  "material_audit": [
    "Steps1-3 explicitly name white concrete, red concrete, red concrete powder, red terracotta, dirt and glass panes. Red material patches are visible but exact per-voxel allocation is not printed.",
    "Steps4-7 explicitly name birch fences, slabs, planks and stairs for side pen, beams, curved roof and roof ventilator.",
    "Step8 explicitly names birch fences, hay bales and torches for stalls and lighting. Hay axis and torch wall/floor mounting must be inferred.",
